<td id="A1.T9.2.1.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding:0.25pt 3.2pt;">Train mean/std after the zero mask with std floor <math id="A1.T9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="10^{-6}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">10^{-6}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
